    "body": "## Summary\n`KimiK25FusedVisionProcessor._to_pil` opened a raw string with `Image.open`, so a path or URL passed in `multi_modal_data` never went through `MediaConnector` or `--allowed-local-media-path`. Non-`data:` strings are now rejected before any file is opened. In-memory images, bytes, and `data:` URIs are unchanged. The chat and tokens-only paths already resolve media through the connector and still pass a `PIL.Image`.\n\n## Changes\n- `vllm/transformers_utils/processors/kimi_k25_vision_fused.py`: reject local paths, `file:` URLs, and `http(s)` URLs in `_to_pil`. Image and video-chunk frames share this function.\n- `tests/transformers_utils/processors/test_kimi_k25_vision_fused.py`: cover a real image path, a `file:` URL, an `http` URL, a missing path, a non-image file, and a video-chunk frame path. All raise the same `ValueError`. A `PIL.Image` still loads.\n\n## Codepath coverage\n- `LLM.generate` with a string inside `vision_chunk` image or video-chunk frames hits `_to_pil` and is rejected.\n- Chat, `LLM.chat`, and tokens-only content parts still fetch through `MediaConnector` and pass a `PIL.Image`, which `_to_pil` accepts.\n- No other processor calls `Image.open` on a caller-supplied path. `inkling.py` opens bytes only.\n\n## Duplicate-work check\nSearched open, draft, and merged pull requests for `kimi_k25_vision_fused`, `_to_pil`, and `KimiK25FusedVisionProcessor`. No open or merged diff rejects this `Image.open` on a raw string. The merged fused-preprocessing change introduced the open and did not confine it. No private fork exists for this report. This is not a duplicate.\n\n## Tests\n- `.venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/transformers_utils/processors/test_kimi_k25_vision_fused.py -v` — 4 passed.\n- `.venv/bin/pre-commit run --files` on the two changed files — passed.\n\n## AI assistance\nThis PR was developed with AI assistance.\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)\n\n<!-- codex-pr-hygiene-validation -->\n## Rebase validation — 2026-10-27\n\nRebased onto upstream main, preserving the original fix and current surrounding behavior. The duplicate audit found no complete merged or open replacement for this PR’s remaining control.\n\nKept the restricted image loader and wired the existing regression file into an active CPU CI job.\n\nValidation on macOS CPU: **4 passed**. All applicable changed-file pre-commit checks and `git diff --check` passed.\n\n```bash\nVLLM_TARGET_DEVICE=cpu VLLM_PLUGINS='' PYTHONPATH=. HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1 .venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/transformers_utils/processors/test_kimi_k25_vision_fused.py -q --tb=short -p no:cacheprovider\n```\n\nNative GPU/RDMA execution and model evaluations were not run during this rebase; required CI and human review remain pending. AI assistance (OpenAI Codex) was used for the conflict resolution and validation.\n",
